intent: "ES1 P3 SHIPPED 2026-06-01 — X3.5 PROVE stage wired into CEG pipeline. 9-state sealed typestate (Proven=X3.5-PROVE=4) inserted between Verified=3 and Predicted=5 (all subsequent ordinals 5..=8 renumbered). prove_claim gated by Option<ClaimKind> (None = no Z3 cost). predict() MOVED from Execution<Verified> to Execution<Proven> (compiler-enforced: 6 GatewayDeps construction sites caught at type-check). new offensive_integration re-export module (19 LOC, src/offensive_integration.rs) isolates gateway from touring-offensive internal layout. 5 new tests (4 unit in typestate.rs + 1 integration in pre_exec.rs). 12 files modified (4 gateway + 2 benches/tests + new module + 5 dependents). 3958/3958 touring-hooks lib tests pass (3953 -> 3958, +5 net). 118 ceg_e2e + 2 capnp_embed_e2e PASS. 0 regressions, 0 new orphans. 4.5ed consumed of 7 budget. Stub->Void contract preserved. HONEST SCOPE: defense-in-depth only — speculative driver integration (S-12 accept-prefix wiring) is P3.5 followup. CAH interface.formal-verify 0.65 -> CONFORME expected ~0.85+ after oracle re-run. META-LESSON: type system as enforcement — predict() move caught all 6 call sites (not just 3 the architect knew about) at type-check time, demonstrating sealed typestate discipline. 1 pre-existing test failure (e2e_diagnostic_rfc100::touring_binary_wired_and_healthy) NOT introduced by P3 — environmental wiring_diagnostic kind_unknown=1070."
